; A macro whose every rule has an expression template, invoked in
; declaration position, and an invocation matching no rule (MAC-LANG-14,
; MAC-LANG-18).
;
; Each template here is one expression; a declaration position needs
; declarations, so the invocation is `AX3027` at the use. An invocation
; matching no rule is `AX3018` naming every shape the macro accepts.
(macro esimp ((esimp (+ a 0)) a)
  ((esimp other) other))

(esimp (+ 1 0))

(esimp)

(:: main Int)
(fn (main)
  (esimp 1 2 3))
